OL,3,GNEWSAMum's anger as drink and drug
OL,4,Adriver who killed two children released
OL,5,Afrom prison
OL,6,
OL,7,FA mother has described the justice
OL,8,Fsystem as a "disgrace" after a driver
OL,9,Fwho killed her two children was
OL,10,Freleased from prison after serving half
OL,11,Fof his sentence.
OL,13,FMartin Newman, 45, killed four-year-old
OL,14,FGracie-Ann and Jayden-Lee, three, after
OL,15,Fcrashing his van into the family's
OL,16,Fstationary car on the M4 near Newport
OL,17,Fon 5 February 2022.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
