OL,3,GNEWSAMum's anger as drink and drug
OL,4,Adriver who killed two children released
OL,5,Afrom prison
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhiannon Lucas, 30, said Newman - who
OL,8,Fhad been drinking red wine while
OL,9,Fdriving and had traces of cocaine in
OL,10,Fhis system - had been released halfway
OL,11,Fthrough his sentence of nine years and
OL,12,Ffour months.
OL,14,FThe Ministry of Justice (MOJ) said any
OL,15,Foffenders released on licence "must
OL,16,Fabide by strict conditions or risk
OL,17,Fbeing sent back to prison."
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
